{
    "title": "Disney Speedstorm",
    "description": "Drift and drag into this hero-based action combat racer, set on high-speed circuits inspired by Disney and Pixar worlds. Master each Racer\u2019s ultimate skills on the arcade racetrack, and claim victory in this multiplayer racing experience from the creators of the Asphalt series!\r\n \r\n<h1>Disney and Pixar full battle racing mode</h1>\r\nDisney Speedstorm presents a deep roster of Disney and Pixar characters! From the Beast, Mickey Mouse, Captain Jack Sparrow, Belle, Buzz Lightyear, Stitch, and many more ready to drift in this kart racing combat game. Upgrade each Racer\u2019s stats and karts to make the most of their skills!\r\n \r\n<h1>Arcade kart racing game</h1>\r\nAnyone can play Disney Speedstorm, but mastering skills and techniques like timing your nitro boosts, drifting around corners, and adapting to dynamic track circuits are crucial to dominating each race.\r\n \r\n<h1>Multiplayer racing has never been easier</h1>\r\nPick your Racer and speed solo through action-packed tracks, or challenge friends in local and online multiplayer modes. You can compete against players from around the globe!\r\n\r\n<h1>Customize karts to your own style</h1>\r\nChoose your Racer\u2019s suit, a flashy kart livery, and show off wheels and wings while competing across rip-roaring circuits. All of this and more is possible with the extensive customization features that Disney Speedstorm provides!\r\n\r\n<h1>Disney and Pixar inspired arcade racetracks</h1>\r\nStart your kart engine in environments inspired by Disney and Pixar worlds. Race on thrilling circuits from the docks of the Pirates of the Caribbean\u2019s Kraken Port to the wilds of Aladdin\u2019s Cave of Wonders or the Scare Floor from Monsters, Inc., you can experience action in these worlds from a perspective geared specifically to drive and drag in battle combat mode, and even play in multiplayer mode!\r\n \r\n<h1>New content racing your way</h1>\r\nThe action never slows down in Disney Speedstorm thanks to seasonal content to keep you racing. New Disney and Pixar Racers will be added regularly, bringing new skills for you to master (or overcome), and unique racetracks will be created often to add new strategy into the mix. Support Crew characters, environments, customization options, and collectibles will also drop in regularly, so there\u2019s always more to experience.\r\n\r\n_____________________________________________\r\n\r\nVisit our official site at http://gmlft.co/website_EN\r\nCheck out the new blog at http://gmlft.co/central\r\n\r\nDon't forget to follow us on social media:\r\nFacebook: http://gmlft.co/SNS_FB_EN\r\nTwitter: http://gmlft.co/SNS_TW_EN\r\nInstagram: http://gmlft.co/GL_SNS_IG\r\nYouTube: http://gmlft.co/GL_SNS_YT\r\n\r\nThis app allows you to purchase virtual items within the app and may contain third party advertisements that may redirect you to a third party site.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: http://www.gameloft.com/en/conditions-of-use\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.gameloft.com/en/legal/disney-speedstorm-privacy-policy\r\nEnd-User License Agreement: http://www.gameloft.com/en/eula",
    "descriptionHTML": "Drift and drag into this hero-based action combat racer, set on high-speed circuits inspired by Disney and Pixar worlds. Master each Racer\u2019s ultimate skills on the arcade racetrack, and claim victory in this multiplayer racing experience from the creators of the Asphalt series!<br> <br><h1>Disney and Pixar full battle racing mode</h1><br>Disney Speedstorm presents a deep roster of Disney and Pixar characters! From the Beast, Mickey Mouse, Captain Jack Sparrow, Belle, Buzz Lightyear, Stitch, and many more ready to drift in this kart racing combat game. Upgrade each Racer\u2019s stats and karts to make the most of their skills!<br> <br><h1>Arcade kart racing game</h1><br>Anyone can play Disney Speedstorm, but mastering skills and techniques like timing your nitro boosts, drifting around corners, and adapting to dynamic track circuits are crucial to dominating each race.<br> <br><h1>Multiplayer racing has never been easier</h1><br>Pick your Racer and speed solo through action-packed tracks, or challenge friends in local and online multiplayer modes. You can compete against players from around the globe!<br><br><h1>Customize karts to your own style</h1><br>Choose your Racer\u2019s suit, a flashy kart livery, and show off wheels and wings while competing across rip-roaring circuits. All of this and more is possible with the extensive customization features that Disney Speedstorm provides!<br><br><h1>Disney and Pixar inspired arcade racetracks</h1><br>Start your kart engine in environments inspired by Disney and Pixar worlds. Race on thrilling circuits from the docks of the Pirates of the Caribbean\u2019s Kraken Port to the wilds of Aladdin\u2019s Cave of Wonders or the Scare Floor from Monsters, Inc., you can experience action in these worlds from a perspective geared specifically to drive and drag in battle combat mode, and even play in multiplayer mode!<br> <br><h1>New content racing your way</h1><br>The action never slows down in Disney Speedstorm thanks to seasonal content to keep you racing. New Disney and Pixar Racers will be added regularly, bringing new skills for you to master (or overcome), and unique racetracks will be created often to add new strategy into the mix. Support Crew characters, environments, customization options, and collectibles will also drop in regularly, so there\u2019s always more to experience.<br><br>_____________________________________________<br><br>Visit our official site at http://gmlft.co/website_EN<br>Check out the new blog at http://gmlft.co/central<br><br>Don&#39;t forget to follow us on social media:<br>Facebook: http://gmlft.co/SNS_FB_EN<br>Twitter: http://gmlft.co/SNS_TW_EN<br>Instagram: http://gmlft.co/GL_SNS_IG<br>YouTube: http://gmlft.co/GL_SNS_YT<br><br>This app allows you to purchase virtual items within the app and may contain third party advertisements that may redirect you to a third party site.<br><br>Terms of Use: http://www.gameloft.com/en/conditions-of-use<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.gameloft.com/en/legal/disney-speedstorm-privacy-policy<br>End-User License Agreement: http://www.gameloft.com/en/eula",
